"Radio Control Receivers are normally used for pilot control. While exclusive"
" pilot control via ground stations using telemetry is possible, it is not "
"recommended. (However, it is possible to control the vehicle via ground "
"station software using a joystick. See :ref:`Joysticks <common-joystick>`."
