#: 8384017decc741b58c2d9919a4fcad2b c3eecebbb64b4bd986f3022b9dd5809a
#: cc66bf612d0e4b51bd48861f4e1269b6 ef609fdabeb3405bb52a458f90473123
msgid "IBUS receivers"
msgstr "IBUS接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:53
#: 31e08c91c2b74254974f169ea06d205f 5f6a6f7b9af04c009951e90b5b0ae89e
#: a59b547c85d345738237fdb5df3741b1 ecac5be3e223453a8ad7c89fbf868e6c
msgid "MULTIPLEX SRXL version 1 and version 2 receivers."
msgstr "MULTIPLEX SRXL版本1和版本2接收机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:55
#: 162d2cf0cb93453782a7a923190ffa7c 225e164dc1fc4e3786f159960635a6a1
#: 87f9bdd51da14315a06706fd57e6e079 b757b513055d45b991d9ef727593c3f2
msgid ""
"For traditional single-wire-per-channel (PWM) receivers a PPM encoder can be"
" used to convert the receiver outputs to PPM."
msgstr "对于传统的单线每通道（PWM）接收机，可使用PPM编码器将接收机输出转换为PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:58
#: 108cb7651857420fad77c527990ac60d 5457d8bee39e4b50b2665dedd8733c2f
#: 7a0e854a8c334500bdbcb5bdcd9dd563 c11a42b2bcd84ffd9d0f13d8fe977a42
msgid ""
"As of ArduPilot 4.0 versions of firmware, any autopilot UART may be used as "
"an input for an RC receiver, instead of the designated RCin or SBUS input "
"pin, by setting that port's ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` to 23. However, some serial"
" protocols require inversion (SBUS,FPort) and the UART must be capable of "
"using the ``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` parameter to invert the RX input, otherwise, "
"an external inverter will be required. This also allows a second RC receiver"
" to be attached to the autopilot for redundancy. If the first receiver "
"(first detected valid after boot) fails, then the second will be used. Note "
"that whatever RC input ranges and trims were calibrated will be used for the"
" second when it becomes active. Both receivers MUST be set to send no pulses"
" in failsafe for this to work properly. :ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` bit 10"
" must be set also."
msgstr ""
"从ArduPilot 4.0版本固件开始，任意飞控UART均可用作遥控接收机输入，替代专用的RCin或SBUS输入引脚，方法是将该端口的 "
"``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` 设置为23。但某些串行协议需要信号反相（SBUS、FPort），且UART必须能通过 "
"``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` "
"参数反相RX输入，否则需要外部反相器。此功能还允许连接第二个遥控接收机以实现冗余。若第一个接收机（启动后首个检测到的有效接收机）失效，将切换使用第二个。注意，校准的遥控输入范围和微调值也将用于激活后的第二个接收机。两个接收机在失控保护时必须均设置为不发送脉冲才能正常工作。还须设置"
" :ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` 第10位。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:62
#: 2aea7fbe2f2641aaa00917df34facfc2 9d2ef152733849f2ba07660260801c8b
#: b9722ac60aad49b693bf47ae03048d3d c5973cf734d2422eabbcf76f68863c05
msgid ""
"Information about compatible receivers and how they are connected can be "
"found in :ref:`common-rc-systems`. Also see :ref:`common-multiple-rx` for "
"use of multiple RC receivers"
msgstr ""
"有关兼容接收机及连接方式的信息，请参见 :ref:`common-rc-systems`。多遥控接收机的使用请参见 :ref:`common-"
"multiple-rx`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:68
#: 2035321372ce4c3681e5eda9904c0da8 553d9937ae784b3ab97c442a0377710e
#: 7977762b238d4f06b185b05cfdd3d478 9a58773f1edd4ba989a49273d607ca87
msgid "FRSky Taranis Transmitter"
msgstr "FRSky Taranis发射机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:71
#: 217996d9930a40b6839489d73d031d52 577a9b413f3f43388008bf580bfba8e1
#: 7078f06faf7146278c4b77a7720a5180 efdc6f9a2aa640929db99b3d020d02d2
msgid "Motor/Servo Connections"
msgstr "电机/舵机连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:73
#: 8e5526c56ced4f819f379576ee3702ed d13683cb83c84c6abfc4eb40a7b60df5
#: ee9bd8a087aa47c68c46e471c42efec5 f4a1779db8cd4012b584b011e4a17fd6
msgid ""
"Motor ESCs and/or PWM Servos are attached to the PWM outputs of the "
"autopilot."
msgstr "电机ESC和/或PWM舵机连接到飞控的PWM输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:75
#: 22c6e0eb72d24a329f73e735c3ee18f1 d182e4d7ba94467fbb97b439cec75da1
#: ddf842ecee5940799fd7d64cfd3237d5 e6f3224501be4cc2a5119b230715477e
msgid ""
"They are labeled either as MAIN/AUX outputs or just as OUTPUTs. These "
"outputs provide the PWM or Dshot signals for motor ESC or servo control of "
"flight surfaces. They can also be sometimes used as general purpose I/O pins"
" for controlling relays, parachutes, grippers, etc."
msgstr ""
"这些输出标注为MAIN/AUX输出或仅标注为OUTPUT。它们为电机ESC或舵机提供PWM或DShot信号。有时也可用作通用I/O引脚，控制继电器、降落伞、机械爪等。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:77
#: 40797534e4f2458e93b9d05c878aa62f 53c0c196eab94eee9bed34f7886a7ffe
#: 8d2b56a5039a4792a12ad7bdd82ce13e e2b56b0b4fac44ce8236dcfe5628c6f9
msgid ""
"Those controllers with MAIN/AUX output labels usually indicate that a IOMCU "
"co-processor is being employed. These provide outputs intended for use as "
"the motor/servo outputs and provide a redundant means of control via RC if "
"the main autopilot fails. The MAIN outputs come from this co-processor, "
"while the AUX designated outputs are controlled directly from the autopilot."
" Most board level autopilots do not use an IOMCU and have outputs only "
"labeled OUTPUTx or Mx."
msgstr ""
"带有MAIN/AUX输出标签的飞控通常表明使用了IOMCU协处理器。这些输出用于电机/舵机控制，并在主飞控失效时通过遥控提供冗余控制手段。MAIN输出来自协处理器，而AUX输出由飞控直接控制。大多数板级飞控不使用IOMCU，其输出仅标注为OUTPUTx或Mx。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:79
#: 216629cea6424992a149e37e142d16f4 378874824f4b415396967ed541cb344e
#: b3b3fb68858f425f8a06138968d7b314 e767affc80294d718da8dd7282cd05ea
msgid ""
"This distinction is important, since AUX outputs(and OUTPUTs from autopilots"
" without an IOMCU) can be used as GPIOs as well as PWM or Dshot. While MAIN "
"outputs can only be used for PWM."
msgstr ""
"这一区别很重要，因为AUX输出（以及无IOMCU飞控的OUTPUT）可用作GPIO，也可用作PWM或DShot。而MAIN输出只能用于PWM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:81
#: 08ecba1de4764a09bab24811b6f9719c 23dbb9f7545840f39297c146f5167aa5
#: 397c3469a68b4a2790ba315ab028767a 4afea98530494c6ea0ee3e0207836235
msgid ""
"A few autopilots that do NOT use an IOMCU label their outputs as MAIN, so "
"actually do have the capability of use as GPIOs and/or Dshot ESC control "
"outputs. CUAV V5 Nano and Holybro Pixhawk 4 Mini are examples."
msgstr ""
"少数不使用IOMCU的飞控将其输出标注为MAIN，实际上这些输出具备GPIO和/或DShot ESC控制输出能力。CUAV V5 "
"Nano和Holybro Pixhawk 4 Mini就是典型例子。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:83
#: 2cf325506d914d0896acf4552afa6917 2e3bb72f4bce4cf38098a972cebd6e11
#: 7f357989f2fa497dbcbc572714148f28 de19af72a8e444089696f72890f98bbb
msgid ""
"Often these outputs are provided on 3 pin connector strips supplying or "
"distributing servo power and ground, in addition to the individual output "
"signals. This power is usually provided externally, such as by the ESC or a "
"BEC, although some autopilots provide this power from internal regulators."
msgstr ""
"这些输出通常通过3针连接器排提供，分配舵机电源和地线，并提供各自的输出信号。电源通常由外部供给，例如由ESC或BEC提供，但部分飞控通过内部稳压器供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:85
#: 18baaee712d2468ab25f49d3772f0e4f 2146d8e83cdf4ba6a25539d985047155
#: 5b8ff85880b74beeb0410beb2d640704 fea9ab38abbb468bb868c393393cbf62
msgid "A connection example for Rover"
msgstr "地面车辆的连接示例"

